<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 67 0 R
/E (Package pricing is for basic rooms; amenities in Barkot, Uttarkashi, and Kedarnath are limited. Power outages and limited backup are common. Hot water available 5-8 a.m. ; some hotels provide a bucket. Water and electricity on set schedules. Room upgrades, alcohol, and extra charges paid at the hotel. Valid ID proof required; company not liable for ID issues. Inform us of medical conditions in advance. Special requests depend on availability. Limited parking; check with reception for departure. Extra charges for room heaters. Additional mattresses for extra adults, not beds. Some hotels lack lifts; inform us for health concerns.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
287 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 67 0 R
/E (Be patient as drivers navigate hilly terrain and limited parking in Sonprayag/Phoolchatti. Vehicle replacement outside Haridwar/Rishikesh may take time. Local transportation costs may apply if the vehicle breaks down. Pilgrim cars stop after 8 p.m. No compensation for unused services if delayed. Restricted vehicle entry in some areas with specific time slots. Night travel not advised; adjust morning sightseeing for afternoon transfers.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [2]
>>
